le="padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">Item 4.</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%;text-decoration:underline"><a style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%;text-decoration:underline" href="#id8819e477d96467bbe2635ac10a11ba9_169">Mine Safety Disclosures</a></span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="text-align:right"><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%;text-decoration:underline"><a style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%;text-decoration:underline" href="#id8819e477d96467bbe2635ac10a11ba9_169">47</a></span></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">Item 5.</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%;text-decoration:underline"><a style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%;text-decoration:underline" href="#id8819e477d96467bbe2635ac10a11ba9_172">Other Information</a></span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="text-align:right"><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;f