y recognized lease revenue of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-17" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseLeaseIncome" scale="6" id="f-1064">5.0</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-1" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseLeaseIncome" scale="6" id="f-1065">8.9</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million during the three and six months ended June&#160;30, 2026, respectively, and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-18" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseLeaseIncome" scale="6" id="f-1066">1.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-19" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseLeaseIncome" scale="6" id="f-1067">1.2</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million during the three and six months ended June&#160;30, 2025, respectively, which is included in &#8220;<span style="-sec-ix-hidden:f-1068"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:f-1069"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:f-1070"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:f-1071">services revenue</span></span></span></span>&#8221; and &#8220;services revenue - related parties&#8221; on the unaudited condensed consolidated statements of operations and comprehensive income (loss). </span></div><div style="padding-left:27pt"><span><br/></span></div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="us-gaap:LessorOperatingLeasePaymentsToBeReceivedMaturityTableTextBlock" id="f-1072" escape="true"><div style="padding-left:27pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Maturities of lease payments for the Company&#8217;s outstanding long-term leases at June&#160;30, 2026 are as follows (in thousands):</span></div><div style="padding-left:27pt"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:94.736%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:83.930%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:13.870%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td co